---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="Preschool Program - Marietta Childcare"
  description="Discover Marietta Childcare's Preschool Program for ages 3-5 with pre-K preparation, academic readiness, and creative learning.">
  <section class="relative py-32 overflow-hidden w-screen -ml-[calc((100vw-100%)/2)]">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0">
      <img 
        src="/images/Background_Images/preschoolers_building_wooden_block_tower_background.jpg" 
        alt="Preschool learning" 
        class="w-full h-full object-cover"
      />
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/40"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="relative z-10 max-w-[1280px] mx-auto px-6 lg:px-20">
      <h1 class="text-4xl lg:text-6xl font-black mb-6 text-white drop-shadow-lg">Preschool Program</h1>
      <p class="text-lg mb-12 max-w-2xl text-white drop-shadow-md">Pre-K preparation, academic readiness, and creative learning for ages 3-5 with structured and play-based activities.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-20 px-6 lg:px-20">
    <div class="max-w-[1280px] mx-auto">
      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-3xl mb-12">
        <p>
          Marietta Childcare's Preschool Program serves children ages 3 to 5 with a comprehensive curriculum focused on pre-K preparation, academic readiness, and creative learning. The Preschool Program at Marietta Childcare combines structured learning with play-based activities to support cognitive, social, and physical development.
        </p>

        <h2>Pre-K Preparation</h2>
        <p>
          Marietta Childcare's Preschool Program prepares children for kindergarten success through age-appropriate academic activities. The Preschool Program includes letter recognition, number concepts, phonemic awareness, and early literacy skills that build a foundation for academic learning.
        </p>

        <h2>Academic Readiness</h2>
        <p>
          The Preschool Program at Marietta Childcare develops academic readiness skills including fine motor control, listening comprehension, and problem-solving abilities. Marietta Childcare's educators use intentional teaching strategies to support cognitive development and school readiness.
        </p>

        <h2>Creative Learning</h2>
        <p>
          Marietta Childcare believes creativity is essential to learning and development. The Preschool Program includes art projects, music, dramatic play, and hands-on activities that encourage creative expression and imagination.
        </p>

        <h2>Group Activities & Social Development</h2>
        <p>
          The Preschool Program at Marietta Childcare emphasizes group activities that develop social skills and cooperation. Marietta Childcare's preschoolers participate in circle time, cooperative games, and collaborative projects that build friendships and social competence.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-12">
        <div class="bg-primary/5 p-6 rounded-lg">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-4">Curriculum Areas</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm">
            <li>✓ Early literacy</li>
            <li>✓ Math concepts</li>
            <li>✓ Science exploration</li>
            <li>✓ Social studies</li>
            <li>✓ Arts and crafts</li>
            <li>✓ Physical education</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-secondary/5 p-6 rounded-lg">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-4">Age Range & Options</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm">
            <li>✓ Ages 3-5 years</li>
            <li>✓ Full-time programs</li>
            <li>✓ Part-time options</li>
            <li>✓ Flexible scheduling</li>
            <li>✓ Extended care hours</li>
            <li>✓ Summer programs</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-primary/10 to-secondary/10 p-8 rounded-lg mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Preparing for Kindergarten</h2>
        <p class="mb-6">Marietta Childcare's Preschool Program focuses on kindergarten readiness and school success. The Preschool Program develops academic skills, social-emotional competence, and independence that prepare children for the transition to kindergarten.</p>
        <a href="/contact" class="inline-block bg-primary text-white px-8 py-3 rounded-full font-bold hover:scale-105 transition-transform">
          Schedule a Tour
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Related Programs & Resources</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
          <a href="/programs/toddler-program" class="text-primary font-bold hover:underline">Toddler Program →</a>
          <a href="/programs/pre-k" class="text-primary font-bold hover:underline">Pre-Kindergarten →</a>
          <a href="/resources/school-readiness" class="text-primary font-bold hover:underline">School Readiness Checklist →</a>
          <a href="/resources/child-development" class="text-primary font-bold hover:underline">Child Development Guide →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
